  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In this Mission, you\u2019ll program a simple interactive experience where you control a character in a living room scene and move around to collect objects. \n\nYou'll be able to choose from a variety of characters and collectible objects. In our example, we'll use a robot vacuum that maneuvers to pick up dirt around the room."
